# Sources of the knowledge-representation study (r1/web-knowledge-representation). Claims drawn from them are in 4.3.kg.

n: 2.13
name: knowledge-representation-sources
kind: hub
is: The sources of the knowledge-representation study of 2026-11-24: the report itself, two NUMS.Go files, one private note of the old body, and 35 public pages and papers. The study read the pages through a summarising fetch; the figures and quotations carried into hub 4.3 were afterwards matched in the raw text of each page on 2026-11-24.
at: 2026-11-24
by: r1/web-knowledge-representation

n: 2.13.1
name: web-knowledge-representation.md
kind: source
is: The study report: a survey of knowledge representations, published token measurements, a comparison against six requirements, a proposed block format, a byte and hash probe, and ten open questions. 759 lines.
path: coherence-seed/study/r1/web-knowledge-representation.md
date: 2026-11-24
got: 2026-11-24
at: 2026-11-24
by: r1/web-knowledge-representation

